      "note": "Editorial link along the Mistral Large line: the announcement presents Mistral 3 as the next generation and Large 3 as Mistral's most capable model to date, without naming a predecessor; Mistral Large 24.11 was the previous Large release. The models overview lists Large 3 as the alternative for the retired Large 1.0 and 2.0 endpoints, but Medium 3.5 for Large 2.1 (24.11)."
    }
