  "notes": "Announced together with the Ministral 3 series in Introducing Mistral 3. The post says a reasoning version was coming soon; none was found in the docs, the changelog or the mistralai Hugging Face organisation by 2026-10-01. The Hugging Face card lists not being a dedicated reasoning model as a known limitation, so the reasoning category is not used. The docs page also lists the moving alias mistral-large-latest, which is not recorded."
